We analyzed the increasing risk of cyber attacks such as unauthorized access and fraud.
We proposed an AI-based system to detect suspicious activities in real time.
The system uses a machine learning model for anomaly detection.
A risk scoring mechanism classifies threats based on severity.
A dashboard interface is designed to monitor live traffic and alerts.
We included a user verification step using OTP (simulated).
An automated response system is planned to block suspicious actions.
A recovery mechanism is designed for legitimate users.
The system architecture follows Detection → Verification → Response → Recovery.
Overall, the design focuses on combining AI detection with user involvement.
